{"format":1,"key":"zone:tanaris","path":"/lore/zone/tanaris","name":"Tanaris","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"tanaris","name":"Tanaris","path":"/lore/zone/tanaris"},"levels":"","description":"Tanaris is a vast, sweltering desert spanning the southern reaches of Kalimdor, defined by rolling sand dunes and blistering heat. At its heart lies…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:tanaris","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Tanaris is a vast, sweltering desert spanning the southern reaches of Kalimdor, defined by rolling sand dunes and blistering heat. At its heart lies Gadgetzan, a neutral trading outpost operated by the goblins of the Steamwheedle Cartel. Beyond the bustling settlements, the dunes conceal hostile sand trolls, dangerous silithid hives, and the hidden domain of the bronze dragonflight.","Tanaris is a barren, sun-scorched wilderness. Within the walled city of Zul'Farrak, the hardened Sandfury trolls guard their isolated domain. Today, the desert floor is ruled by hyenas, basilisks, and scorpids, while subterranean tunnels snake beneath the baking earth."],"hash":"dd77e5","voices":{}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Tanaris (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Tanaris_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Tanaris","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Tanaris"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/gadgetzan","n":"Gadgetzan","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/zul-farrak","n":"Zul'Farrak","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/caverns-of-time","n":"Caverns of Time","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/steamwheedle-port","n":"Steamwheedle Port","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ruins-of-uldum","n":"Ruins of Uldum","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/shimmering-flats","n":"Shimmering Flats","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/gaping-chasm","n":"Gaping Chasm","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/887-southsea-freebooters","n":"Southsea Freebooters","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/southern-gold-road","n":"Southern Gold Road","k